# AI Execution Harness

Before executing any task in this repository:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` at repository root.
2. Read `.ai-harness/PM-EXECUTION-CONTRACT.md`.
3. Identify the task contract under `.ai-harness/tasks/`.
4. Run `python .ai-harness/scripts/preflight.py --task <contract>` before modifying files.
5. Stop on preflight failure, baseline mismatch, task ambiguity or required tool failure.
6. Run `python .ai-harness/scripts/run_task_gate.py --task <contract>` before final reporting.
7. Use only the machine-derived status from `derive_status.py`.
8. Fail closed: missing evidence, tool failure, and UNKNOWN are not PASS.
9. Do not merge or start the next slice unless explicitly authorized for the exact current head SHA.
10. Do not self-certify COMPLETE, CLOSED, SA APPROVED or NEXT SLICE AUTHORIZED.
